# Reports written by `regente shadow|chain|mission --output <file>`.
#
# The name is whatever the caller passes, so no pattern catches all of them --
# a stray `--output r.txt` in the repo root is still untracked and still one
# `git add -A` away from being committed. These cover the convention already in
# use (SHADOW-REPORT.txt, CHAIN-REPORT.txt) plus a directory to aim --output at
# when the name does not matter.
#
# Deliberately NOT `*-PROOF.txt`: AGENTRUNNER-PROOF.txt is tracked evidence.
*-REPORT.txt
*-report.txt
reports/
